mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Need control flow?] --> Q1{Once or many?}
  Q1 -->|Once branch| Cond[if-else or switch]
  Q1 -->|Repeat| Q2{Known collection or query?}
  Q2 -->|List or set| ForEach[for variable : collection]
  Q2 -->|Query rows| SoqlFor[for variable : SOQL]
  Q2 -->|Unknown count| While[while or do-while]
  Cond --> Q3{Reusable named work?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Meth[Method with parameters and return or void]
  Q3 -->|No| Inline[Keep inline]
  Meth --> Q4{Can it fail?}
  Q4 -->|Recover or cleanup| Try[try catch finally]
  Q4 -->|Caller must see it| Throw[throw; do not empty-catch]
